  "latex": "\\bar X=\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i,\\qquad S^2=\\frac{1}{n-1}\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\big(X_i-\\bar X\\big)^2,\\qquad E(\\bar X)=\\mu,\\ E(S^2)=\\sigma^2",
  "summary": "样本均值与（无偏）样本方差是最常用的统计量；样本方差分母取 n−1 保证无偏性。",
